BT /F1 10 Tf 46.00 698.89 Td (code-based questions an interviewer can ask from this FounderLink codebase.) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 46.00 671.89 Td (Project Flow Summary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 46.00 645.89 Td (FounderLink is a full-stack microservices platform that connects startup founders,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 46.00 631.89 Td (investors, co-founders, and admins. The frontend is Angular. The backend is split into) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 46.00 617.89 Td (Spring Boot microservices. Docker Compose runs the supporting infrastructure.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54.00 596.89 Td (Browser -> Angular frontend -> API Gateway -> Spring Boot microservice -> Controller ->) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54.00 583.89 Td (Service -> Repository / Feign / RabbitMQ -> PostgreSQL / Redis / Notification Service ->) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54.00 570.89 Td (Response back to Angular) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 553.89 Td (- Angular frontend runs from sprint frontend/founderlink and manages session, forms,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 539.89 Td (  dashboards, and service pages through AppStore.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 525.89 Td (- API Gateway is the single backend entry point on port 8080.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 511.89 Td (- Config Server centralizes service configuration on port 8888.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 497.89 Td (- Eureka Server provides service discovery on port 8761.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 483.89 Td (- PostgreSQL stores auth, user, startup, investment, team, and messaging data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 469.89 Td (- Redis is used by user-service for user profile caching.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 455.89 Td (- RabbitMQ carries notification events to notification-service.) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 46.00 431.89 Td (Main User Journey) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 405.89 Td (- A user opens the Angular app and chooses a role such as founder, investor, co-founder,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 391.89 Td (  or admin.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 377.89 Td (- Registration goes to POST /auth/register through the gateway.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 363.89 Td (- Auth service encodes the password, assigns a role, creates an OTP, syncs profile data to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 349.89 Td (  user-service, and publishes an OTP notification event.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 335.89 Td (- User verifies OTP using POST /auth/verify-otp.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 321.89 Td (- Login goes to POST /auth/login and returns a JWT.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 307.89 Td (- Angular stores the JWT and sends it in the Authorization header for protected requests.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 293.89 Td (- Founders create startup listings through startup-service.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 279.89 Td (- Admins approve or reject startup listings.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 265.89 Td (- Investors discover approved startups and create investment requests.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 251.89 Td (- Founders review investment requests and update status.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 237.89 Td (- Founders invite co-founders using team-service.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 223.89 Td (- Users create conversations and send messages through messaging-service.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 209.89 Td (- Notification-service consumes RabbitMQ events and sends emails.) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 46.00 185.89 Td (Service Responsibilities) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 46.00 154.89 Td (API Gateway) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 135.89 Td (- Routes frontend calls to /auth, /users, /startups, /investments, /teams, /messages, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 121.89 Td (  /notifications.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 107.89 Td (- Handles CORS and exposes aggregated Swagger links.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 46.00 88.89 Td (Auth Service) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 60.00 69.89 Td (- Owns registration, OTP verification, login, roles, JWT creation, and password reset.) Tj ET
