BT /F2 16 Tf 46.00 785.89 Td (Architecture Questions) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 46.00 756.89 Td (Q. Why did you choose microservices for FounderLink?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 742.89 Td (A. Each domain has a separate responsibility: auth, profiles, startups, investments,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 728.89 Td (teams, messaging, and notifications. This improves separation of concerns and makes each) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 714.89 Td (service easier to test and scale independently.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 46.00 693.89 Td (Q. What is the role of API Gateway?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 679.89 Td (A. The gateway gives the frontend one backend URL and routes requests to the correct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 665.89 Td (service. It also centralizes CORS and Swagger aggregation.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 46.00 644.89 Td (Q. Why are Config Server and Eureka used?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 630.89 Td (A. Config Server centralizes service properties. Eureka allows services to register and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 616.89 Td (discover each other, which is useful when services move, restart, or scale.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 46.00 595.89 Td (Q. Why use RabbitMQ for notifications?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 581.89 Td (A. Email sending should not block user actions. Services publish NotificationEvent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 567.89 Td (messages, and notification-service handles email delivery asynchronously.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 46.00 546.89 Td (Q. Why is Redis used only in user-service?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 532.89 Td (A. User profile reads are common across services. Redis reduces repeated database hits) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 518.89 Td (for profile lookup while keeping the source of truth in PostgreSQL.) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 46.00 490.89 Td (Spring Boot and Java Questions) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 46.00 461.89 Td (Q. Explain the controller-service-repository pattern in this project.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 447.89 Td (A. Controllers expose REST endpoints, services contain business logic, and repositories) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 433.89 Td (handle persistence through Spring Data JPA.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 46.00 412.89 Td (Q. What does @RequiredArgsConstructor do here?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 398.89 Td (A. Lombok generates a constructor for final fields, so Spring can inject dependencies) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 384.89 Td (without manual constructor code.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 46.00 363.89 Td (Q. Where is business logic placed?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 349.89 Td (A. Business logic is mainly in service classes such as AuthService, StartupService,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 335.89 Td (InvestmentService, TeamService, MessagingService, and UserService.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 46.00 314.89 Td (Q. Why is PasswordEncoder used in AuthService?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 300.89 Td (A. Passwords must not be stored as plain text. PasswordEncoder stores a secure hash and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 286.89 Td (checks login using matches\(\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 46.00 265.89 Td (Q. How does AuthService normalize roles?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 251.89 Td (A. It trims input, uppercases it, removes ROLE_ prefix and separators, maps COFUNDER to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 237.89 Td (COFOUNDER, and checks against role records.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 46.00 216.89 Td (Q. What happens if a user logs in without OTP verification?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 202.89 Td (A. AuthService generates a new OTP, saves it, sends a notification, and rejects login) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 188.89 Td (until verification is complete.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 46.00 167.89 Td (Q. Why does StartupService.create set startup id to null?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 153.89 Td (A. It prevents a detached-entity merge when the client accidentally sends an id during) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 139.89 Td (create.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 46.00 118.89 Td (Q. Why does StartupService use SecurityContextHolder?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 104.89 Td (A. It reads the authenticated user id from the JWT context, so the founder id cannot be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 58.00 90.89 Td (forged in the request body.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 46.00 69.89 Td (Q. How is investment status handled?) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
